<disclaimer-bar/><view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="title">快乐8 · 选十</view><view class="subtitle">AI 辅助规则筛号 · 1–80 中随机组合<br/>历史为模拟数据，不代表真实开奖走势</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">策略开关</view><view class="row"><text>冷热窗口</text><switch checked="{{config.hotEnabled}}" data-key="hotEnabled" bindchange="toggle" color="#087f83"/></view><view wx:if="{{config.hotEnabled}}"><view class="field"><view class="label">近 N 期（1–80）</view><input type="number" value="{{config.window}}" data-key="window" bindinput="param"/></view><view class="label">出现次数：最少 / 最多</view><view class="pair"><input type="number" value="{{config.minCount}}" data-key="minCount" bindinput="param"/><input type="number" value="{{config.maxCount}}" data-key="maxCount" bindinput="param"/></view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><text>当前遗漏区间</text><switch checked="{{config.omitEnabled}}" data-key="omitEnabled" bindchange="toggle" color="#087f83"/></view><view wx:if="{{config.omitEnabled}}"><view class="label">下限 / 上限（0–80期）</view><view class="pair"><input type="number" value="{{config.low}}" data-key="low" bindinput="param"/><input type="number" value="{{config.high}}" data-key="high" bindinput="param"/></view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><text>连号上限</text><switch checked="{{config.runEnabled}}" data-key="runEnabled" bindchange="toggle" color="#087f83"/></view><view wx:if="{{config.runEnabled}}" class="field"><view class="label">最大连续长度（1–10）</view><input type="number" value="{{config.maxRun}}" data-key="maxRun" bindinput="param"/></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><text>分区均衡</text><switch checked="{{config.zoneEnabled}}" data-key="zoneEnabled" bindchange="toggle" color="#087f83"/></view><view wx:if="{{config.zoneEnabled}}"><view class="label">四区：1–20 / 21–40 / 41–60 / 61–80</view><view class="label">每区最少 / 最多</view><view class="pair"><input type="number" value="{{config.minPer}}" data-key="minPer" bindinput="param"/><input type="number" value="{{config.maxPer}}" data-key="maxPer" bindinput="param"/></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">复现 seed（留空则自动生成）</view><input value="{{seed}}" bindinput="seedInput" placeholder="例如：my-seed-01" maxlength="80"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="generate">生成候选号码</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="savePreset">保存当前策略预设</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section">候选 {{pool.length}} 个</view><text class="tag">已选 {{selected.length}} / 10</text></view><view class="muted">实心球为定稿号码，点按增删；满10个时先取消再添加。</view><view class="balls"><view wx:for="{{balls}}" wx:key="n" class="ball {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" data-n="{{item.n}}" bindtap="ball">{{item.label}}</view></view><view class="code">{{result.summary}}<br/>seed：{{result.seed}}<br/>策略指纹：{{result.fingerprint}}<br/>过滤后可用：{{result.eligibleCount}} 个</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="again">再来一组（新 seed）</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">定稿并复制号码（含免责水印）</button><button class="primary" bindtap="guide">定稿 · 去购彩指引</button></view><view class="footer">遗漏为距最近一次出现经过的模拟期数，最新一期出现记为0。策略仅改变筛选规则，不提升中奖概率。</view></view>
